<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney on Allegiance.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney on Allegiance.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Geoffrey Harris initiated coverage of Allegiance Corp with an outperform rating, his office confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Allegiance is the health-care products and cost-management company recently spun off from Baxter International Inc.</p>
<p>-- Its shares were up 1/8 at 18-1/8.</p>
</text>
